{"status":"completed","summary":"Repaired and applied the SQLite v1→v2 migration on node1. The catalog is healthy after a full node restart, with original IDs/descriptions preserved and prices initialized to zero.","actions_performed":["Replaced bin/upgrade.py with an atomic, repeat-safe migration.","Added price_cents as INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 with a nonnegative CHECK constraint.","Made schema_version update the final operation within the transaction.","Verified rollback with an injected mid-upgrade failure on a disposable database copy.","Preserved root-only rollback assets: catalog.db.v1.backup and bin/upgrade.py.pre-repair.","Restarted node1 safely and verified full recovery.","Retained RHEL 10.0 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Preserve existing IDs and descriptions while initializing price_cents to zero","command_ids":["cmd-2d8291e45c684982","cmd-40a7aacdcea341f8"],"summary":"Catalog contains exactly (1, Paper, 0) and (2, Tape, 0); integrity check passes."},{"requirement":"Enforce nonnegative price_cents","command_ids":["cmd-61a121e3a36e4d00","cmd-40a7aacdcea341f8"],"summary":"Default insertion produced zero and negative values were rejected by the CHECK constraint, including after restart."},{"requirement":"Advance schema_version only after the whole upgrade succeeds and preserve usable v1 on failure","command_ids":["cmd-72980ec352914d82","cmd-79f32f8192dd4d8b"],"summary":"Migration uses one explicit transaction with rollback. An injected failure after ALTER left version=1, the original two-column schema and rows intact, and v1 writes operational."},{"requirement":"Migration is safe to repeat","command_ids":["cmd-61a121e3a36e4d00","cmd-ad3bdb3ecb0b4171"],"summary":"Repeated execution succeeded without changing the database hash and succeeded again after reboot."},{"requirement":"Secure recovery material and clean final state","command_ids":["cmd-c8b25d7fe80444e4","cmd-40a7aacdcea341f8"],"summary":"Integral v1 backup and original script are root-owned mode 0600; no SQLite transient sidecars or test rows remain."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-b73fcc1dda6149be","cmd-8493953358644d32","cmd-be81f8721ad6411d","cmd-ad3bdb3ecb0b4171"],"summary":"Healthy baseline used boot ID 24d7af09-d9dc-453c-9bbd-d48f7dc4eb4e; reboot was acknowledged; recovered boot ID changed to 0b8a8c8d-2c67-404d-a8f6-59b5f96ea414; system, catalog, schema, migration, and retained OS/kernel all recovered."}]}
